#. Tag: screen
#: man-meinproc4.8.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The output can be a bit daunting, since one small mistake can cause a "
"cascade of errors. \n"
"The trick is to look at the first error, fix that error, save the file, and "
"run <command>meinproc4</command> again."
msgstr ""
"Izlaz može biti malo obeshrabrujući, pošto mala pogreška može prouzrokovati "
"kaskadu grešaka. \n"
"Trik je pogledati prvu grešku, popraviti tu grešku, snimiti datoteku, i "
"pokrenuti <command>meinproc4</command> ponovo."

