#. Tag: title
#: man-meinproc4.8.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Upotreba"

#. Tag: para
#: man-meinproc4.8.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The most common way to run <command>meinproc4</command> is simply as "
"<literallayout>\n"
"<userinput><command>meinproc4</command> <replaceable>docbook-file</"
"replaceable>\n"
"</userinput>\n"
"</literallayout> where <replaceable>docbook-file</replaceable> is usually "
"index.docbook. This command creates HTML pages from the DocBook file. Note "
"that these pages are only viewable in KDE-based browsers (like Konqueror)."
msgstr ""
"Najčešći način za pokretanje <command>meinproc4</command> je "
"<literallayout>\n"
"<userinput><command>meinproc4</command> <replaceable>docbook-datoteka</"
"replaceable>\n"
"</userinput>\n"
"</literallayout> gdje je <replaceable>docbook-datoteka</replaceable> obično "
"index.docbook. Ova komanda kreira HTML stranice iz DocBook datoteke. Zapazi "
"da su ove stranice jedino vidljive u KDE-baziranom pregledniku (kao "
"Konqueror)."

#. Tag: para
#: man-meinproc4.8.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you need to view the HTML output in another browser (for example, if "
"you're placing it on line), use <literallayout>\n"
"<userinput><command>meinproc4</command> --stylesheet <replaceable>stylesheet-"
"name</replaceable> <replaceable>docbook-file</replaceable>\n"
"</userinput>\n"
"</literallayout> where <replaceable>stylesheet-name</replaceable> is the "
"full path to one of the XSL stylesheets in $KDEDIR/share/apps/ksgmltools/"
"customization. To produce output suitable for the web, you can use "
"<command>kde-web.xsl</command> or <command>kde-chunk-online.xsl</command>. "
"See the README file in that directory for more details."
msgstr ""
"Ako vam je potrebno da vidite HTML izlaz u drugom pregledniku (naprimjer, "
"ako ga postavljate online), koristite <literallayout>\n"
"<userinput><command>meinproc4</command> --stylesheet <replaceable>stylesheet-"
"ime</replaceable> <replaceable>docbook-datoteka</replaceable>\n"
"</userinput>\n"
"</literallayout> gdje je <replaceable>stylesheet-ime</replaceable> cijela "
"putanja do XSL stylesheets u $KDEDIR/podijeliti/aplikacije/ksgmlalati/"
"prilagođavanje. Za izradu izlaza pogodnih za web, možete koristiti  "
"<command>kde-web.xsl</command> ili <command>kde-chunk-online.xsl</command>. "
"Za više detalja pogledaj README datoteku u tom direktoriju."

